`Persistence: registry Run key and startup folder writes (Sysmon 13). Correlate with the process that wrote the value.`
index=sysmon sourcetype="*WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=13
| search TargetObject="*CurrentVersion\Run*" OR TargetObject="*Startup*"
| table _time, host, Image, TargetObject, Details
